   "text": "At SF 2.5 the HMPE bulk sections carry a steady centrifugal load of 28–40% of rated break strength (40% raw; 28% if the 30% strength derate is applied in sizing). Published HMPE guidance is to keep sustained load at or below ~20% of break for multi-year life (SK78 ≈ 8 years at 20% load, 20 °C). The centrifugal load is genuinely sustained in the rotating frame, so this is the unfavourable regime."
